    "body": "The default ephemeral port range on OpenBSD (1024-49151) overlaps with the test framework's static port range starting at `TEST_RUNNER_PORT_MIN`, the same way FreeBSD's does (see #34346).\r\n\r\nExtend `set_ephemeral_port_range()` to OpenBSD. The socket option and its values are identical to FreeBSD's, so only the platform check changes.\r\n\r\n~Fixes https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/36099.~",
